; spells.eval - the reworked spell tiers (docs/spell-updates-plan.md), one
; section per outcome. tools\SpellTest.py runs this and JUDGES it; on its own it
; only reports. Every section header is `=== <name> ===` and the judge reads the
; readouts between one header and the next, so a section must stay self-contained.
;
; Maren (member 2) casts unless a section says otherwise. Her hands start as the
; starter kit has them (fire left, project right); a section that needs the right
; hand clear puts the project rune back first. Power is moved with `setskill`:
; school level 0 reaches no threshold, level 30 reaches all of them.
logecho on
reset
timescale 0
lockstep on
seed 11
goto crypt1
learn 2 fire
learn 2 earth
learn 2 air
learn 2 water

; --- TIER 1: the hand spells -------------------------------------------------

echo === flame-held ===
equip torch 2 1
cast 2 0 fire
torch

echo === flame-walltorch ===
equip rune_project 2 1
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc douse
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === flame-brazier-weak ===
tp 8 4
face e
castsvc douse
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === flame-brazier-strong ===
setskill 2 fire 30
cast 2 0 fire
castsvc fire

echo === gust-flare ===
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 air
castsvc fire

echo === splash-brazier-weak ===
step 2
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-brazier-strong ===
setskill 2 water 30
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-walltorch ===
setskill 2 water 0
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire
cast 2 0 water
castsvc fire

echo === splash-fill ===
equip waterskin_empty 2 1
cast 2 0 water
torch
cast 2 0 water
torch
cast 2 0 water
torch
equip rune_project 2 1

echo === pebble-hand ===
learn 0 earth
cast 0 0 earth
torch

echo === pebble-feet ===
cast 0 0 earth
castsvc floor

; Leave crypt1 with its torch still out (splash-walltorch), so the level is
; STASHED doused; a new game must find it lit again (it once came back out - the
; stash kept the flag). Before any save or load: this exact order is the one that
; showed it.
echo === newgame-relights ===
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire
goto eval_arena
reset
goto crypt1
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire

; A save made with the torch out must bring it back out over a relight.
echo === douse-saveload ===
castsvc douse
save spells_douse
castsvc light
castsvc fire
load spells_douse
tp 4 3
face n
castsvc fire

echo === gust-shove ===
goto eval_arena
learn 2 air
arena open 9 9
freeze on
tp 14 12
face n
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
cast 2 0 air
monsters
setskill 2 air 30
cast 2 0 air
monsters

; --- THE GRAMMAR: school, form, then one modifier ------------------------------

; The reset above forgot every rune Maren learned, so the rest relearn them.
echo === grammar ===
learn 2 fire
learn 2 earth
learn 2 project
learn 2 protect
learn 2 sight
learn 2 multiple
learn 2 explode
setskill 2 fire 10
setskill 2 earth 10
cast 2 0 fire multiple
cast 2 0 fire multiple project
cast 2 0 fire project multiple explode
cast 2 0 fire sight multiple
heal
cast 2 0 fire project

; --- TIER 2 and 3: bolts and their modifiers -----------------------------------

echo === firebolt ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
spawn skel_warrior 13 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project
step 3
tally
monsters

echo === volley ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project multiple
step 4
tally

echo === burst ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
heal
tp 14 14
face n
spawn skel_warrior 14 11 south 4
spawn skel_warrior 13 11 south 4
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire project explode
step 4
tally
monsters

echo === ward-self ===
heal
cast 2 0 earth protect
char 0
char 2

echo === ward-party ===
heal
cast 2 0 earth protect multiple
char 0
char 1
char 2
char 3

echo === ward-burst ===
arena open 9 9
freeze on
tp 14 12
face n
heal
spawn skeleton 14 11 south
spawn skeleton 13 12 east
spawn skeleton 15 12 west
spawn skeleton 14 13 north
tally reset
cast 2 0 fire protect explode
step 3
tally
monsters
party
char 2

; --- MONSTER CASTERS -----------------------------------------------------------

echo === adept ===
arena open 9 9
heal
tp 14 14
face n
freeze off
tally reset
spawn skel_mage_adept 14 11 south
step 6
tally

; --- REPEL: a strong gust against an arrow in flight ---------------------------

